WEBVTT

00:01:58.101 --> 00:02:00.244
And when I talk about definition,

00:02:00.268 --> 00:02:05.029
I'm talking about your sexual orientation.

00:02:06.274 --> 00:02:10.143
We don't say, "It's a ... gay boy!"

00:02:11.668 --> 00:02:12.957
"A lesbian girl!"

00:02:14.449 --> 00:02:17.958
Those situations don't
really define themselves

00:02:17.982 --> 00:02:20.171
more until the second decade of life.

00:02:21.971 --> 00:02:26.928
Nor do they define your gender,

00:02:26.952 --> 00:02:30.540
which, as different
from your anatomic sex,